+`createPatch(from, to)` (exported from `src/index.ts`) returns a JSON Patch that turns `from` into `to`
+when applied with `applyPatch`. Neither input is mutated and the patch shares no structure with them.
+
+The patch describes only what changed: members are compared recursively and a change is expressed at the
+deepest place that differs. An item added to or removed from an array is added or removed on its own,
+without rewriting the items around it; an item that moved within an array is removed and added back.
+Only when `from` and `to` differ in kind (object, array or scalar) is the whole document replaced. It
+throws an `Error` when `from` or `to` is not a JSON value.
+
